{"id":7411558263,"name":"Pass The Bomb 💣","desc":"Play an intense match of running away from the bomb and try not to get exploded! 💣\n\n🏃‍♂️ Run away from the person holding the bomb!\n💣 If you have the bomb catch anyone to pass them the bomb!\n❎ No breaks! Play fast paced and beat other players!\n⏰ Updates coming regularly! Make sure to look out!\n🫂 Join the group to get exclusive rewards in the future! \n\n👍 Make sure to like the game and favorite it for frequent updates! 👍 \n\n🔥 Like the game for perks 🔥\n\n🐦 Join the group for better bomb accuracy! 🐦","path":"/game/7411558263-pass-the-bomb","slug":"7411558263-pass-the-bomb","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6e1833e2832a83bfb6c5bd464739445ba43654eda18acb325d1cd28c566545d6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6bd0da84c4e8643076ff7910e42dc3a4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":33,"visitor":53326926,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-01T23:19:37.597Z","creator":{"name":"Shark Mayhem Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6683398959ad756aaac1701c","title":"SERVER BREAKER","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78113","gameId":7411558263,"name":"Pass The Bomb 💣","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4fe700e1efd3c9bcfdbaad18f02442d1c9f120956894e25a4b8df425025417eb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-8da772f6d4014b47b144cbdad1dfc1e9-a2a1e686a545.png"},"slug":"7411558263-pass-the-bomb","path":"/game/7411558263-pass-the-bomb","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4fe700e1efd3c9bcfdbaad18f02442d1c9f120956894e25a4b8df425025417eb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-8da772f6d4014b47b144cbdad1dfc1e9-a2a1e686a545.png"},"placeId":7411558263},"slug":"Pass-The-Bomb-SERVER-BREAKER-15153","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":14932,"executes":37,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":true,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e4a44457d86cc5f4bda26bef4558f7dca6e19dd8954d2cee2711bf109f72fee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/7411558263-1719883556056.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/7411558263-1719883556056.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e4a44457d86cc5f4bda26bef4558f7dca6e19dd8954d2cee2711bf109f72fee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/7411558263-1719883556056.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/7411558263-1719883556056.webp"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2024-07-01T23:19:37.597Z","updatedAt":"2024-07-01T23:19:37.597Z","lastBump":"2024-07-01T23:19:37.597Z","script":"--[[\nInstructions:\nThere are 2 ways to break a game, by flinging the player into the void and by killing yourself.\nFling Bomb Holder - If you are not playing, then you can fling the player that is holding the bomb by pressing fling bomb holder button in hopes that player dies by the void. By the way, it only works for maps: city, crossroads, and outsidehouses. Any other maps will be almost impossible to fling the player out of the barriers. If you succesfully kill the player by flinging them into the void and the player didnt leave, then it should break the timer.\nReset - If you are playing, then you can break the timer by getting the bomb and dying with it. You should press the button that teleports to the bomb holder and back to spawn. You go back to spawn because it is less likely that a player can steal the bomb from you. After you get the bomb, you can press the reset button and you have successfully broken the timer.\n]]\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/SQVVs4sw\"))()","features":"Probably not getting patched\nBasically just destroys the bomb which stops the timer which makes the server useless\nREAD INSTRUCTIONS","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6679fa836997fabe7a4a928c","username":"IMakeBestScripts","verified":false,"